# RST01 keyboard combination, armed on "[desk] desktop up" (tools/inject-arm.py desktop=).
# <ticks after arm> <IKBD byte>; Atari scancodes: Ctrl 0x1D, LShift 0x2A, RShift 0x36, Alt 0x38, Delete 0x53 (break |0x80).
# 1) Ctrl+LShift+Alt+Del: LShift excluded (EmuTOS ikbd.c:736) -> must NOT reset.
400 0x1D
410 0x2A
420 0x38
430 0x53
440 0xD3
450 0xB8
460 0xAA
470 0x9D
# 2) Ctrl+Alt with only the Delete BREAK code (0xD3): raw-byte compare (ikbd.c:735) -> must NOT reset.
600 0x1D
610 0x38
620 0xD3
630 0xB8
640 0x9D
# 3) Ctrl+Alt+RShift+Del -> cold reset (ikbd.c:738-741).
800 0x1D
810 0x38
820 0x36
830 0x53
840 0xD3
850 0xB6
860 0xB8
870 0x9D
